WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.244
The close is where discussion becomes
commitment, so it gets its own

2
00:00:04.244 --> 00:00:08.437
place on the agenda: the last few
minutes, with the aim of ending early.

3
00:00:08.437 --> 00:00:10.101
Read back the decisions.

4
00:00:10.101 --> 00:00:13.856
Then read back each action item
with its owner and its due date,

5
00:00:13.856 --> 00:00:16.212
and have each owner confirm it out loud.

6
00:00:16.212 --> 00:00:20.447
Route every parking-lot item, ask what's
missing and what to change about the

7
00:00:20.447 --> 00:00:24.887
meeting next time, and set the next meeting
and its facilitator if one is needed.

8
00:00:24.887 --> 00:00:26.930
Then the work moves outside the room.
